   "brief": "The Treasury Laws Amendment (Modernising Business Communications) Bill 2022 was moved for second reading, modernising several Treasury laws to allow technology-neutral business communications, including electronic signing, flexible document delivery, updated credit communication rules, electronic payment options, and replacement of mandatory newspaper notices with modern methods."
